or other communication, (ii) electronically generated by the sender&rsquo;s email service provider containing the time, date, recipient
email address or (iii) provided by a nationally recognized overnight delivery service shall be rebuttable evidence of delivery in accordance
with clause (i), (ii) or (iii) above, respectively.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"></P>

