Advance</U>&rdquo;</FONT> shall mean have the meaning set forth in &lrm;Section 2.01.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0cm">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0cm">&ldquo;<U>Pricing Period</U>&rdquo;
