or the NYSE American, then the &ldquo;Principal Market&rdquo; shall mean such other market or exchange on which the ADSs are then listed
or traded to the extent such other market or exchange is the principal trading market or exchange for the ADSs.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0cm">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0cm">&ldquo;<U>Promissory Note</U>&rdquo;
shall have the meaning set forth in &lrm;Section 2.01.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0cm">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0cm">&ldquo;<U>Prospectus</U>&rdquo;
shall mean any prospectus (including, without limitation, all amendments and supplements thereto) used by the Company in connection with
a Registration Statement, including documents incorporated by reference therein.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0cm">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0cm">&ldquo;<U>Prospectus Supplement</U>&rdquo;
shall mean any prospectus supplement to a Prospectus filed with the SEC pursuant to Rule 424(b) under the Securities Act, including documents
incorporated by reference therein.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0cm">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0cm">&ldquo;<U>Purchase Price</U>&rdquo;
shall mean (i) the price per Advance Share obtained by multiplying the Market Price by 95% in respect of an Advance Notice delivered by
the Company, or (ii) in the case of any Advance Notice delivered pursuant to an Investor Notice the Purchase Price set forth in &lrm;Section
3.01(b)(ii).</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0cm">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0cm">&ldquo;<U>Registration Limitation</U>&rdquo;
shall have the meaning set forth in &lrm;Section 3.02(b).</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0cm">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0cm">&ldquo;<U>Registration Statement</U>&rdquo;
shall have the meaning set forth in the Registration Rights Agreement.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0cm">&nbsp;</P>

